Default/legacy2097152, explicit Windows profile3145728 per PROCESS, not per package/client. Quotas and shared credit/Model E unchanged. Account plaintext49654, outer51042, material copies49152 (including key8192), headers/metadata, old/new generations, root/issuer/config, crypto/KDF/keygen/signature/provider contexts, all input/password/key buffers, stack, callbacks and retained work. These named arrays alone total149848 if simultaneously instantiated; input cap131072 or generic ciphertext65536 allocations can increase the real graph. Do not treat these bounds, current margin or nested component sizes as automatic reservation or add duplicated bytes twice. No compression allocation is needed for this profile. Full activation and provider/kernel remain UNKNOWN, ED11 total PARTIAL until actual graph/target measurement.

Require standard known-answer and cross-backend crypto tests, exact envelope/archive/TLV positives and corruption/unknown-version/overflow negatives, wrong password/signer/name/cert/key, no unauthenticated parse, cancellation/Stop/uncertain result, retention/wipe/commit/replay/ED11 tests; real VC6/C89/NT4 integration and bounded KDF responsiveness remain qualification gates, not inferred PASS. Synthetic inputs are never authority or operational packages. Actual deployment issuer/signer/retention/validity/backend/custody remain required before real provisioning.

## M8 Acceptance boundary

Nothing in this document is ACCEPTED automatically. Owner must approve exact M0–M8 (including C1–C4 and the existing proposed suite/count/bounds/trust ceremony) before official executor registration in a designated normative record. Preserve original proposals and all accepted ADRs. Approval of this PROPOSED document is not approval of crypto code, algorithms, publication, keys, private signing, network, Browser changes or production/PST release. Later functional hunks need their own exact review. Until that gate, no envelope-dependent implementation or package/password test can honestly be reported PASS.
